otes":6,"source":"both","text":"for on account of Abrahamʼs wife Sarah, the Lordhad completely closed all the wombs in Abimelechʼs household.","from":31},{"book":"GEN","chapter":21,"verse":2,"verseEnd":2,"votes":6,"source":"openbible","text":"So Sarah conceived and bore a son to Abraham in his old age, at the very time God had promised.","from":31},{"book":"GEN","chapter":49,"verse":8,"verseEnd":8,"votes":6,"source":"both","text":"Judah, your brothers shall praise you. Your hand shall be on the necks of your enemies; your fatherʼs sons shall bow down to you.","from":35}],"notes":[],"groups":[{"id":"patriarchs","title":"The patriarchal families","people":6}]}}